      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Additionally, using a Layer 7 CDN provides strong DDoS protection at the edge, significantly reducing DDoS mitigation costs and improving overall streaming stability and security for public worlds.\n\nFurthermore, CDN caching effectively reduces origin server egress traffic by serving viewers from edge nodes instead of directly from the source, which greatly lowers bandwidth costs and reduces the load on the origin server.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
