      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I think this has the added benefit of letting people do 1440p or even 4K streams at higher bitrates for clients that support it. I've done 20-40 Mbps streams in VRChat and it works just fine currently, but I understand that not everyone has a stable enough connection for that.",
